  gradient read 1.000 (min)   write 0.710 mean, 0.000 min, 10.1% of records fully frozen
           <1.0 on the write is the DESIGN here -- a staggered band draws depths inside the no-grad prefix (J6 measured 0.76 mean, 13.8% frozen)
  stagger  n_depths last 6, median 5, collapsed to 1 on 89/547 records   tape_len 7
  embed    frozen=1  z_embed_ratio first 1.058 -> last 0.994 (identity holds it at ~1.0; a trainable map went 2.17x in 23 steps)
  ||E||    92.6 -> 79.4 over the trace (-14.3%)
           znorm_target 78.9, now +0.6% away
  gates    E left-init=1 (w 92.4)   Z left-init=1 (w 129)
           fg 0.181 / ig 0.907   fg_z 0.456 / ig_z 0.848   summary_emb 16.4
