--- state on disk -------------------------------------------------------
  48 resumable checkpoints, newest checkpoint_26531 (69.5% of the horizon)

  note every line above is a MEASURED number the forward pass had to produce, not a flag echo.  None of them says whether Z helps: that is pace/midrun_check.sbatch.
  WARN ||E|| has moved -14.3% across the trace. Settled high is a calibration constant; still climbing is an instability with a schedule -- compare the first and last thirds before deciding.

VERDICT: no failures, 1 warn.  This says the link ran as configured.  It does NOT say the mechanism helps.

=== midrun finished rc=0 -> eval_results/midrun/cortex-final/step_22800_T8 ===

HOW TO READ IT -- the bars, written down before the numbers arrive:
  val NLL      chunk1 is the 'did it break' number (no carry either arm).
               Across the switch, expect PG-19 down and FineWeb-Edu up a
               little.  BOTH up is degradation; PG-19 flat means check
               the switch link actually read the mix pack.
  THE CARRY, DECOMPOSED  the -off tasks now run the full 2x2, so
               results.json carries four rows, not one:
                 E_main       E0Z1 - E1Z1.  E's effect, Z held ON.
                 Z_main       E1Z0 - E1Z1.  Z's effect, E held ON  (= X_off).
                 Z_alone      E0Z0 - E0Z1.  Z's effect with E held OFF.
                 interaction  (E's effect without Z) - (E's effect with Z).
                              NEGATIVE = COMPLEMENTS: E is worth more when
                              Z is present.  This is the design's actual
                              hypothesis and the only sign you cannot read
                              off a single column.
               E1Z1 vs E0Z0 is E AND Z TOGETHER, not E's effect.  Quote
               E_main for E.  At step 11,444 the together number was
               +0.3119 while Z_main was -0.0024, i.e. E was doing
               essentially all of it -- but that was an inference from
               Z's null, not a measurement, because E0Z1 never ran.
  X_off        E1Z0 - E1Z1.  Positive on every J arm ever run, including
               the ones where Z carried nothing.  It is NOT evidence.
  X_content    donor - own.  THE deciding number.  J7 measured +0.2215
               at latent_depth_lo=2; this run trains lo=1, which re-maps
               all 16 slots, so that value does not transfer as-is.
               Zero here with X_off positive is the pre-J7 signature:
               columns load-bearing, contents irrelevant.
  content share  X_content / X_off.  0% on ctrl/mix/slow, 103% on J7.
  chunk1_max_spread  must be ~0 -- the cells must agree where no carry
               exists, or they differ in something other than the carry.
  chance margin  any cell within 0.25 nats of ln(vocab) is scoring noise
               and every delta computed from it is a difference of two
               noise levels.
